{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T23:18:23.303Z","ordinal":199,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a118a0-06d2-7290-9d3d-9aeaa56e8112","turn_id":"01a118a0-078f-75a2-9f80-8ea8515b2cba","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_05884ae67e45cde2016ac6d23090f88195abeb87659c202194","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"{\n  \"request_id\": \"8c795c4e92274393b1d148a722787014\",\n  \"stage\": \"implementation\",\n  \"snapshot_hash\": \"c561ae969c3a416a5c44181c819b89b14b2ae66f51579ff46a0cb1381303aa6f\",\n  \"verdict\": \"blocked\",\n  \"source_candidate_verdict\": \"blocked\",\n  \"complete_product_acceptance\": \"pending\",\n  \"summary\": \"原插入漏步已修复，普通P/F/P和有限实际WPF来源支持该项闭合。但新增到达边界暴露了一个可由正常UI编辑触发的误执行：等待中的路径流程被替换为无路径顺序定义时，校验提前返回，原游标被改为新链首并执行新增资源。该重要实现项须修复；本次固定一次授权已消耗，不授予追加审查或生产许可。\",\n  \"evidence_refs\": {\n    \"PR\": \"contracts/_previous-report/report.json\",\n    \"U\": \"prior.json#/unknowns；每项原文由其稳定key定位，未修改\",\n    \"EQ\": {\n      \"previous_snapshot\": \"2543a6b07d42494ca1a0983208fa9921\",\n      \"comparison\": \"独立比较两个冻结snapshot清单。既有源码仅WorkflowRunner.cs新增本次六行，以及非执行文档Docs/technical/mistletoe-startup-migration-recovery.md变化；新增PathArrivalRevisionTests.cs。Planner、WorkflowPlan.Path、WorkflowNodeSchedule、RunStore、Host、迁移和其他既有依赖字节未变。\",\n      \"runner_diff\": \"旧5d1b806ea024c53c749bf3b5695e1250b1215409c0cba29f76b3618d4391937f；当前e9afdaa655f3ccfcd7190d7bb19799544141d95eea6652b9b510cfa84807b700。独立diff只有到达边界对账及continue。\",\n      \"reuse_limit\": \"继承PR各项原有等级、阶段和证据边界。原结构入口、截止、迁移恢复的特定根因结论保留；不把旧pass扩展为当前整版pass。当前模式降级问题单独登记。\"\n    },\n    \"AR\": \"contracts/_workflow/final-ui-01a11220/arrival-revision-01a11808\",\n    \"POLICY\": [\n      \"contracts/AGENTS.md\",\n      \"contracts/_previous-contracts/Docs/design/mistletoe-complete-usable-delivery-20261006.md\",\n      \"contracts/_previous-contracts/_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/DELIVERY-FIRST-POLICY.md\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"snapshot_verification\": {\n    \"source_files\": 10243,\n    \"source_bytes\": 138919341,\n    \"contract_files\": 1486,\n    \"contract_bytes\": 150464197,\n    \"initial_and_final_mismatches\": [],\n    \"snapshot_sha256_matches\": true,\n    \"prior_preservation\": {\n      \"findings\": 101,\n      \"unknowns\": 39,\n      \"all_objects_equal_to_previous_request_prior\": true,\n      \"previous_disposition_ids_obligations_and_grades_match\": true\n    },\n    \"compile_inputs\": {\n      \"entries\": 313,\n      \"all_present_in_snapshot\": true,\n      \"green_and_restored_equal_candidate_identity\": true,\n      \"hash_mismatches\": []\n    },\n    \"git\": {\n      \"branch\": \"main-OldTeaBag-B168\",\n      \"head\": \"1840c4847dc6a288992f555ace1bbbfdf119011a\",\n      \"status_lines_read\": 3693,\n      \"staged_names\": \"\",\n      \"patches\": 5,\n      \"patch_hashes_match_git_identity\": true,\n      \"material_outside_repair\": \"五份未暂存patch均为既有文档变更；本次审查未归属、提交或修改它们。\"\n    },\n    \"limits\": \"全集哈希验证不等于逐行语义认证。未读取真实User、未执行产物或测试、未认证全部SDK/native依赖。\"\n  },\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PATH-ARRIVAL-REVISION-INSERT-1\",\n      \"severity\": \"important\",\n      \"obligation\": \"implementation\",\n      \"status\": \"closed\",\n      \"root_cause\": \"原DriveAsync在节点时间等待之前对账，醒来后仍以旧node/plan求条件并持久选中旧后继；后续重载正确保留已选游标，因此错过等待期间保存的新后继。\",\n      \"counterexample\": \"旧定义gate等待后去end；等待期间保存gate→inserted→end。原实际run及两条红夹具只产生gate/end。\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:783\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:1890\",\n        \"source/Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/PathArrivalRevisionTests.cs:14\"\n      ],\n      \"repair_steps\": [\n        \"已完成：成功节点等待及原截止/过期检查后，调用共享ProcessBoundaryActions。\",\n        \"已完成：计划替换后continue，重新进入停止、暂停、身份、时间及节点闸门，避免用旧node配新计划。\",\n        \"已完成：路径RecomputeSuccessor保留持久选中游标，已完成条件不重新求值，完成身份过滤及回边轮次规则未改。\"\n      ],\n      \"tests\": [\n        \"badb13f9-232c-c0b8-c080-c104b27c4f42\",\n        \"5959820a-b250-bf06-5dc8-e5ff3e2ce150\",\n        \"11a28bc0-c617-eddd-e84b-0092f4257431\",\n        \"587930f1-31ec-99e3-cbe1-85df5d3d1fc3\",\n        \"6957d625-04ac-480a-c584-e49b1871bd58\",\n        \"dbcd7be9-4bcc-9da8-649f-1f08de8f8941\"\n      ],\n      \"closure_evidence\": [\n        \"AR/red/arrival-revision.trx：六例4P2F；两插入用例Expected gate/inserted/end、Actual gate/end。\",\n        \"AR/green/arrival-revision.trx和AR/restored/arrival-revision.trx：新六例均Passed；全受影响范围309P、原两LocalWait失败、0Other。\",\n        \"AR/negative/arrival-revision.trx：仅移除新增对账/continue后，同两插入断言再次失败，4P2F。\",\n        \"AR/negative-source-restored.json及独立哈希：恢复Runner为e9afdaa655f3ccfcd7190d7bb19799544141d95eea6652b9b510cfa84807b700。\",\n        \"AR/actual/result.json：run-ba802a8f2909在修订81fd132c00239df77ca0eace4c7156a64e82b28901bce5dcef7f34310f98a878产生gate、n-944c012a、end各一次；零前置/资源提交，Succeeded、TailReached、Wait=null。\",\n        \"AR/actual/private/native-ui-source.jsonl:171、188、227：正式保存、登记重载、到达后结果读回的原生来源。\",\n        \"AR/actual/apps-process-result.json、apps-tree-terminal.json及result.json：正常终态、Job树0和记录的数据保留结论。\"\n      ],\n      \"limits\": \"仅闭合原插入根因及已记录有限行为。实际是判断/结束路径，不是资源/game/Skip验收；下面的新重要问题仍阻断当前候选。证据为普通来源，不是legacy认证receipt。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PATH-ARRIVAL-MODE-DOWNGRADE-1\",\n      \"severity\": \"important\",\n      \"obligation\": \"implementation\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"root_cause\": \"ValidatePathCursor在新计划!HasPaths时先return false，未检查运行已绑定的pathLayout及原路径游标。新增等待后对账在尚无完成结果时采用该顺序计划，RecomputeSuccessor走completionOutcomes.Count==0分支取新FirstOccurrence；原待到达节点和路径模式被静默替换。布局元数据本身不计入HasPaths。\",\n      \"counterexample\": \"以gate(schedule.time=10:00, condition→end)及end启动路径运行，gate等待且尚无NodeOutcomes。等待期间在正式编辑UI删除gate/end，追加一个目录中有效的整龙资源R，不连接路径、不改其时间，保存新修订，可登记ReloadDefinition也可自动检测。RemoveNodeCommand删除原节点；AppendNodeCommand生成新的NodeId、resource.oneDragonConfig和有效Ref，但不加flow.route；BuildSubmissionCopy对未编辑的新增节点不补Path或route。保存后新计划HasPaths=false、预检可执行。10:00醒来新增ProcessBoundaryActions调用ValidatePathCursor早退，RecomputeSuccessor取R链首，改run.WorkflowRevision和游标后continue；下一轮以该新游标执行R。当前定义/游标/调度可一致通过后续准入，后续守卫不能恢复原gate到达。旧版在醒来先执行原gate，其完成锚在替换定义中不可定位时取链尾，不会在这个窗口提交R。此为静态确定的正常UI可达路径，未声称本审查实际运行了反例。\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowPlan.Path.cs:8\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowPlan.Path.cs:18\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:786\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:1860\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:1998\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.EditParts.cs:124\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.EditParts.cs:210\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.EditParts.cs:261\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/WorkflowPathEditVm.cs:83\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/WorkflowScheduleViewModel.cs:117\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.cs:376\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowStore.cs:226\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.Admission.cs:1942\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Views/MistletoePage.xaml:1758\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Views/MistletoePage.xaml:1830\"\n      ],\n      \"repair_steps\": [\n        \"在共享ValidatePathCursor的!HasPaths早退之前读取原运行路径绑定；已经绑定pathLayout的路径运行不得采用无路径计划。抛出既有InvalidOperationException，使ProcessBoundaryActions沿用旧plan和原arrival；Resume入口同样保守拒绝模式降级。\",\n        \"保留既有当前节点删除合同：继续原到达，不猜新入口；不要删除原绑定、重新建立运行身份或从新链首补跑。\",\n        \"继续允许没有原路径绑定的新顺序运行，及保持路径模式、合法身份/车道的到达前修订；无需禁止所有类型或资源编辑。\",\n        \"集