sion和游标后continue；下一轮以该新游标执行R。当前定义/游标/调度可一致通过后续准入，后续守卫不能恢复原gate到达。旧版在醒来先执行原gate，其完成锚在替换定义中不可定位时取链尾，不会在这个窗口提交R。此为静态确定的正常UI可达路径，未声称本审查实际运行了反例。\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowPlan.Path.cs:8\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowPlan.Path.cs:18\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:786\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:1860\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowRunner.cs:1998\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.EditParts.cs:124\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.EditParts.cs:210\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.EditParts.cs:261\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/WorkflowPathEditVm.cs:83\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/WorkflowScheduleViewModel.cs:117\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/ViewModels/TaskCenterPanelViewModel.cs:376\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WorkflowStore.cs:226\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.Admission.cs:1942\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Views/MistletoePage.xaml:1758\",\n        \"source/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Views/MistletoePage.xaml:1830\"\n      ],\n      \"repair_steps\": [\n        \"在共享ValidatePathCursor的!HasPaths早退之前读取原运行路径绑定；已经绑定pathLayout的路径运行不得采用无路径计划。抛出既有InvalidOperationException，使ProcessBoundaryActions沿用旧plan和原arrival；Resume入口同样保守拒绝模式降级。\",\n        \"保留既有当前节点删除合同：继续原到达，不猜新入口；不要删除原绑定、重新建立运行身份或从新链首补跑。\",\n        \"继续允许没有原路径绑定的新顺序运行，及保持路径模式、合法身份/车道的到达前修订；无需禁止所有类型或资源编辑。\",\n        \"集中修复该共享层并补针对性行为验证，保留原插入P/F/P、六例、原失败和实际来源；本报告不授予另一审查请求。\"\n      ],\n      \"tests\": [\n        \"新增显式Reload